i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KEhCwU9Oaf4Q7kNvwHrigtV&_nc_oc=Adrlowd838zKR6EZcG6w_Z63sfvUX6hr6DNF-uwmKxgMDGxGE7neG5q0xIh7dgFSEfI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLYIT_YXrf3C6-bf-Z0M09DW8_nF44z-wfrk8Opif5tnQ&oe=6AAEA566"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CB-r51l8t2QQ7kNvwGwm6kb&_nc_oc=Ado1JY3reN-HU-fgxvqu0JdDF-0-lrycBc9CdM5fQw5h3P5ReJBT2UatkbRyWEMBhRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKOAMf89r0q0EbZB007LBhRNz-v0rZNukYKdl3z2i3sTw&oe=6AAE9AB2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R9sopW0ycAEQ7kNvwEz0jig&_nc_oc=AdqZ_3Yye_qu2pGBoiWdHHL0a0bmUMBx-xOOuVM3UT9zN-64V59jc50RRw633TcelrQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK2SZAnmTfkZ4HiRLlGUbGMcSz-CRcVdktjYTvMm8iPjw&oe=6AAE947B"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xCWg4j0J9xMQ7kNvwEq1B7n&_nc_oc=AdoPLZ6ltlWVu4_cjKGGcRAGFHqUzYSXFpS-z_SfZn_4SSKrqOWzRrkpEu54WalGx8k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJDOjb3MoI1TpgNEXmCL_kOEE-he3hvqHWeE9RwqYe6TQ&oe=6AAEA9F3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zc99tTTZU3QQ7kNvwE2W9Pg&_nc_oc=Ado2CK0ei0oYKTkFnw48Z0n6lTNBqrZVaJVSo16TmJBiCGTKA8vIgmz9SRmjxuyVm6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJaNP8zhZU6hge6DaLHn2VgTW70eGOEzQ6HWMlf7gMjjA&oe=6AAEA7F2"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O9xQTq9xapMQ7kNvwF3Qdvb&_nc_oc=Adou9oXrLTtLYlS5gWU_-Vruf2baAAWIit46_sMCbZk_dkAFWFYMphtiyhxcz0A9znM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLFUS95AjblneYXpC9O6OyxqNXrUujsog_JSmLA8gjBNA&oe=6AAE9F53"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T8UAs_CaBrcQ7kNvwHvMUcK&_nc_oc=Adp-_s3CKkD-Y0jGY3KhVtCd446rAZ2rQ9jT3y9-gAKaQc1qZAyOmW6Ocvtzo3l-BrM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJarjpByER5Td2Li4BQXoAQriWduFFCeyrDEWRuColeJg&oe=6AAE9B6F"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HIg2doElMgAQ7kNvwEeWpl5&_nc_oc=AdpS4qwdn4LyM-y_1bYkDEgfLVyb8JEWz5p0az4uS9qCn7iIybRJ6l_e9TuwIpoGBz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQImhCBg5OEK5K9hD0QSkU4f1_6NESl3hvE_G1glBJ9R5g&oe=6AAEA722"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_